#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Instalación"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where can I find &superkaramba; <acronym>RPM</acronym>'s?"
msgstr ""
"Onde se poden atopar paquetes <acronym>RPM</acronym> do &superkaramba;?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &superkaramba; web site (<ulink url=\"http://netdragon.sourceforge.net"
"\"></ulink>) has a list of user-submitted RPMs for several distributions. "
"Other user-submitted RPMs have been posted to kde-look.org and to the "
"&superkaramba; Help forum."
msgstr ""
"A páxina web do &superkaramba; (<ulink url=\"http://netdragon.sourceforge.net"
"\"></ulink>) ten unha lista de RPM fornecidos polos usuarios para varias "
"distribuicións. Outros RPM enviados polos usuarios están colocados no kde-"
"look.org e no foro de axuda do &superkaramba;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:83 index.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid "When I try to compile, I get this error:"
msgstr "Cando tento compilar, obteño este erro:"

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:84
#, no-c-format
msgid "<computeroutput>Python.h: No such file or directory</computeroutput>"
msgstr ""
"<computeroutput>Python.h: No such file or directory (non existe o ficheiro "
"ou cartafol)</computeroutput>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You will need to install the <literal>python-devel</literal> package. Once "
"that package is installed you should run <command>./configure</command> and "
"<command>make</command> again."
msgstr ""
"Ten que instalar o paquete <literal>python-devel</literal>. Despois de "
"instalalo, deberá executar <command>./configure</command> e <command>make</"
"command> de novo."

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid "<computeroutput>cannot find -lselinux</computeroutput>"
msgstr ""
"<computeroutput>cannot find -lselinux (non se pode atopar -lselinux)</"
"computeroutput>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You will need to install the <literal>libselinux-devel</literal> package. "
"Once that package is installed you should run <command>./configure</command> "
"and <command>make</command> again."
msgstr ""
"Ten que instalar o paquete <literal>libselinux-devel</literal>. Despois de "
"instalalo, deberá executar <command>./configure</command> e <command>make</"
"command> de novo."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After running <command>./configure</command>, <command>make</command> and "
"<command>make install</command>, the &superkaramba; executable is not where "
"I expected it to be. When I try to run <command>superkaramba</command> from "
"the command line it says <computeroutput>command not found</computeroutput>."
msgstr ""
"Despois de executar <command>./configure</command>, <command>make</command> "
"e <command>make install</command>, o executábel do &superkaramba; non está "
"onde sería de esperar. Cando tento executar o <command>superkaramba</"
"command> na liña de comandos, di <computeroutput>command not found</"
"computeroutput> (comando non atopado)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In some distributions <command>./configure</command> has a default prefix "
"path that differs to what you might expect. For example, in &Mandrake; the "
"default prefix is <filename class=\"directory\">/usr/local/kde</filename> "
"and the executable is installed in <filename class=\"directory\">/usr/local/"
"kde/bin</filename>."
msgstr ""
"Nalgunhas distribuicións, o ./configure ten un lugar de prefixos por omisión "
"que difire do que se podería esperar. Por exemplo, na &Mandrake;, o lugar  de prefixos por omisión é <filename class=\"directory\">/usr/local/kde</"
"filename> e o executábel atópase en <filename class=\"directory\">/usr/local/"
"kde/bin</filename>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:115
#, no-c-format
msgid "There are a few things you can do to fix this."
msgstr "Hai varias cousas que pode facer para corrixir isto."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You could run <command>./configure <parameter>--prefix=/usr</parameter></"
"command> to specify the prefix that you prefer and then try <command>make</"
"command> and <command>make install</command> again. Or you could create a "
"symbolic link in your preferred folder that links to the executable. Or you "
"could add the install folder to your $<envar>PATH</envar>."
msgstr ""
"Pode executar <command>./configure <parameter>--prefix=/usr</parameter></"
"command> para indicar o prefixo que prefire e a continuación tentar con "
"<command>make</command> e <command>make install</command> de novo. Tamén "
"pode crear unha ligazón simbólica no cartafol preferido que estea ligada ao "
"executábel. Pode, finalmente, engadir o cartafol de instalación a  "
"$<envar>PATH</envar>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:127
#, no-c-format
msgid "General"
msgstr "Xeral"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:130
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"How do I get rid of the &kde; panel? Do I have to keep &kicker; running?"
msgstr ""
"Como me podo librar do panel do &kde;? Teño que manter o &kicker; en "
"execución?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Many themes depend on &kicker; and will not work well without it. If you "
"don't want &kicker; to show on your desktop, you can set it to auto-hide. "
"Another solution is to change the auto-hide setting in a <filename>~/.kde/"
"share/autostart/panel.desktop</filename> file. For more information see the "
"wiki page about <ulink url=\"http://wiki.kdenews.org/tiki-print.php?"
"page=Secret+Config+Settings\">secret configuration settings</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Moitos temas dependen do &kicker; e non funcionan ben sen el. Se non quere "
"que o &kicker; apareza na pantalla pódeo configurar para que se agoche "
"automaticamente. Outra solución é mudar a opción de ocultación automática "
"nun ficheiro <filename>~/.kde/share/autostart/panel.desktop</filename>. Para "
"máis información, vexa a páxina do wiki sobre <ulink url=\"http://wiki."
"kdenews.org/tiki-print.php?page=Secret+Config+Settings\">opcións de "
"configuración secretas</ulink>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:144
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Can I run a system tray theme while the &kicker; system tray is running?"
msgstr ""
"Podo executar un tema de bandexa do sistema coa bandexa do sistema do "
"&kicker; a funcionar?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:147
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It's better not to. If you run a theme with a SysTray on it while a regular "
"kicker systray is running, the theme will <quote>steal</quote> all the icons "
"from the first systray. This is because in &kde; and Gnome, the systray "
"icons are really little windows and there is only one copy of each running. "
"If you want to run a system tray theme, you must remove the system tray from "
"&kicker;."
msgstr ""
"É mellor non o facer. Se executa un tema cunha bandexa nel coa bandexa "
"normal a correr, o tema <quote>roubará</quote> todas as iconas da  primeira bandexa. Isto acontece porque, no &kde; e no Gnome, as iconas da "
"bandexa do sistema son de feito xaneliñas e só existe unha copia destas en "
"execución. Se quere executar un tema da bandexa do sistema ten que  eliminar "
"a bandexa do sistema do &kicker;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:157
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I set up my themes to run automatically on startup?"
msgstr ""
"Como configuro os meus temas para que se executen automaticamente no "
"arranque?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turn on &kde; session support in the &kcontrolcenter;. When session support "
"is enabled, any theme that is left running when you logout will "
"automatically start on startup. For some themes you will also need to &RMB; "
"click and reload the theme at least once after running it so that the config "
"file will get written to your home folder."
msgstr ""
"Active o soporte de sesións do &kde; no &kcontrolcenter;. Cando este  soporte estiver activo, todos os temas que estaban en execución cando saíu "
"inícianse automaticamente iniciados no arranque. Para algúns temas, pode que "
"tamén necesite premer co &RMB; e volver a premer polo menos unha vez após a "
"sua execución para que o ficheiro de configuración se grave no cartafol "
"persoal."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:165
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Another solution is to create a desktop config file in the &kde; autostart "
"folder."
msgstr ""
"Outra solución é crear un ficheiro de configuración .desktop no cartafol de "
"arranque do &kde;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:167
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To create a desktop config file, open an editor and enter the following:"
msgstr ""
"Para crear un ficheiro de configuración .desktop, abra un editor e introduza "
"o seguinte:"

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Exec=superkaramba {location of theme file}.theme\n"
"Name={theme name}\n"
"Type=Application\n"
"X-KDE-StartupNotify=false</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Exec=superkaramba {ubicación do ficheiro do tema}.theme\n"
" Name={nome do tema}\n"
"Type=Application\n"
"X-KDE-StartupNotify=false</userinput>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:170
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Then save it as <filename><replaceable>themename</replaceable>.desktop</"
"filename> into the autostart folder at <filename class=\"directory\">"
"$<envar>KDEHOME</envar>/Autostart/</filename>."
msgstr ""
"Despois, gráveo como <filename><replaceable>nome-tema</replaceable>.desktop</"
"filename> no cartafol de arranque en <filename class=\"directory\">"
"$<envar>KDEHOME</envar>/Autostart/</filename>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:177
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Why is the <guimenuitem>Edit Script</guimenuitem> option disabled when I "
"&RMB; click on a theme?"
msgstr "Por que a opción <guimenuitem>Editar Guión</guimenuitem> está  desactivada cando se preme un tema co &RMB;?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Some &superkaramba; themes don't include a <application>Python</application> "
"script. This is normal and those themes will still work fine without one. "
"However, if the theme does use a <application>Python</application> script, "
"&superkaramba; may have not been able to load the script. This is usually "
"due to <application>Python</application> errors. Run the theme from the "
"command line to find out the specific error message."
msgstr ""
"Algúns dos temas do &superkaramba; non inclúen un programa en  <application>Python</application>. Isto é normal e eses programas funcionan "
"ben sen el. Porén, se o tema tiver un programa en  <application>Python</application>, pode que o &superkaramba; non sexa capaz "
"de cargar o programa. Isto normalmente dévese a erros do "
"<application>Python</application>. Execute o tema a partir da liña de "
"comandos para descobrir a mensaxe de erro específica."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:190
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Why is the <guimenuitem>Configure Theme</guimenuitem> menu disabled when I "
"&RMB; click on a theme?"
msgstr "Por que o menú <guimenuitem>Configurar Tema</guimenuitem> está  desactivado cando se preme un tema co &RMB;?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:194
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Configure Theme</guimenuitem> menu is only enabled if the "
"theme has added options to it. Some themes do not have any configuration "
"options or use a different configuration method."
msgstr ""
"O menú <guimenuitem>Configurar Tema</guimenuitem> só está activo se o tema  tiver opcións adicionais para el. Algúns temas non teñen ningunha opción de "
"configuración ou empregan un método de configuración diferente."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:202
#, no-c-format
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Resolución de problemas"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:205
#, no-c-format
msgid "My themes start up in different locations each time I start &kde;."
msgstr ""
"Os meus temas arrancan en sitios diferentes de cada vez que inicio o &kde;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:209
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Close all &superkaramba; themes and then delete any session files in "
"<filename class=\"directory\">$<envar>KDEHOME</envar>/share/config/session/</"
"filename> that begin with &superkaramba;. Restart &kde; and start your "
"themes again. Now they will stay in the right place."
msgstr ""
"Feche todos os temas do &superkaramba; e elimine todos os ficheiros de "
"sesión en <filename class=\"directory\">$<envar>KDEHOME</envar>/share/config/"
"session/</filename> que comecen por &superkaramba;. Reinicie o &kde; e "
"inicie os temas de novo. Daquela estarán no sitio axeitado."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:218
#, no-c-format
msgid "The backgrounds of my themes are black instead of transparent."
msgstr "Os fondos dos meus temas son negros en vez de transparentes."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:220
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In &kde;, transparency only works when the desktop background is a wallpaper "
"image that is centered or scaled. If the background is a plain color or a "
"tiled image then &superkaramba; themes will not be transparent. In Gnome, "
"there is a known issue that themes will have a black background even when a "
"wallpaper is set. Unfortunately there is no current solution. Your theme "
"should work fine otherwise."
msgstr ""
"No &kde; a transparencia só funciona cando o fondo de pantalla é unha imaxe "
"de fondo de pantalla que está centrada ou dimensionada. Se o fondo for unha "
"única cor ou unha imagen en mosaico, os temas do &superkaramba; non son "
"transparentes. No Gnome existe un problema coñecido cos temas que teñen un "
"fondo negro, mesmo cando está seleccionada unnha imaxe de fondo. "
"Desafortunadamente, non existe ningunha solución actualmente. O seu tema "
"debería funcionar ben en caso contrário."

